Subject: virtual-net: accept as the local stream type

A host that wraps the connections its guest accepts needs the concrete
stream and its descriptor: `try_accept_local` returns a `LocalTcpStream`,
which now implements `AsRawFd`, as does `LocalTcpListener`; `try_accept`
boxes the stream as before.

